  "title": "Cake Balls",
  "description": "These cake balls are easy to make with cake mix, store-bought frosting, and candy melts for festive treats, great for gifting or making into pops.",
  "authors": [
    "Allison"
  ],
  "date_published": "2003-12-14T22:02:17-05:00",
